      "start": 32.56383333333333
    },
    {
      "tick": 38,
      "speaker": "user",
      "text": "Walking to the book failed, it wasn't in view.",
      "audio": "assets/media/voice/eb8964a2fc5477edab23.mp3",
      "duration": 3.3309583333333332,
      "start": 37.30479166666666
    },
    {
      "tick": 46,
      "speaker": "assistant",
      "text": "The book must be in view before “go to book” works. Find the bedroom bed in your view and approach it first; then look down to locate the book before trying to approach and pick it up.",
