      "duration": 11.490958333333333,
      "start": 44.035750000000014
    },
    {
      "tick": 46,
      "speaker": "user",
      "text": "Good point, I'll look down at the bed.",
      "audio": "assets/media/voice/d356f31cac5aaf8c22a0.mp3",
      "duration": 2.250958333333333,
      "start": 55.776708333333346
    },
    {
      "tick": 72,
      "speaker": "assistant",
      "text": "Are you holding the book now? If so, take it to the bedroom desk and put it on the desk.",
      "audio": "assets/media/voice/77eddcf3def04896ea5f.mp3",
      "duration": 5.050958333333333,
      "start": 69.52766666666675
    },
    {
      "tick": 72,
      "speaker": "user",
      "text": "Yep, got it. Taking it to the desk.",
      "audio": "assets/media/voice/eabc68cb942f3905780e.mp3",
      "duration": 2.8109583333333332,
      "start": 74.82862500000007
    },
    {
      "tick": 106,
      "speaker": "assistant",
      "text": "That was the other bedside lamp; the lamp across the bed is still on. Go to that lamp and switch it off, then pick up the mug from the nightstand.",
      "audio": "assets/media/voice/12d7c2a0d8873928eff7.mp3",
      "duration": 8.970958333333334,
      "start": 92.7395833333335
    },
    {
      "tick": 106,
      "speaker": "user",
      "text": "I'll put this mug down first, then fix it.",
      "audio": "assets/media/voice/8a8c37fcaf81693b1ffc.mp3",
      "duration": 3.0109583333333334,
      "start": 101.96054166666683
    },
    {
      "tick": 115,
      "speaker": "user",
      "text": "I brought the mug here by mistake, I'll move it to the table first.",
      "audio": "assets/media/voice/19ecf3ce0f500fcf8491.mp3",
